00:21:47,180 --> 00:21:48,390
Sebagai gantinya,

242
00:21:48,974 --> 00:21:50,017
kau tak boleh…

243
00:21:50,600 --> 00:21:53,478
Jangan pernah habiskan nominal besar.

244
00:21:53,562 --> 00:21:55,272
Lagi pula tak ada uangnya.

245
00:21:55,981 --> 00:21:56,898
Ya.

246
00:21:57,524 --> 00:21:58,734
Tapi, kenapa…

247
00:21:59,735 --> 00:22:00,861
tiba-tiba boleh?

248
00:22:08,952 --> 00:22:10,078
Kita terpilih undian.

249
00:22:14,124 --> 00:22:15,834
KIM MIN-SUK TERPILIH UNDIAN…

250
00:22:16,418 --> 00:22:17,294
Gokil!

251
00:22:17,377 --> 00:22:19,129
Ini gila!

252
00:22:19,212 --> 00:22:20,964
Wah, kapan kau terpilih?

253
00:22:21,465 --> 00:22:25,427
- Saat kau selamatkan dunia dengan topeng?
- Wah, ini gila!

254
00:22:25,927 --> 00:22:27,262
- Pasutri baru?
- Ya.

255
00:22:29,348 --> 00:22:31,266
Tunggu, kita sudah menikah?

256
00:22:31,892 --> 00:22:35,187
Formulirnya sudah dicap.
Kau sibuk, aku pergi sendiri.

257
00:22:35,270 --> 00:22:36,104
Oh!

258
00:22:37,314 --> 00:22:38,315
Osan?

259
00:22:39,107 --> 00:22:41,735
Osan masih termasuk daerah ibu kota.

260
00:22:43,153 --> 00:22:43,987
Ya.

261
00:22:45,906 --> 00:22:46,990
- Sang-ung.
- Ya.

262
00:22:47,074 --> 00:22:49,785
- Kita sungguh harus berhemat.
- Ya.

263
00:22:49,868 --> 00:22:51,912
Kita perlu 60 juta won.

264
00:22:51,995 --> 00:22:56,041
Uang muka bisa terpenuhi
kalau aku menguras deposito dan tabungan.

265
00:22:57,167 --> 00:23:00,879
- Sisanya orang tuaku.
- Bagaimana cicilan dan pelunasannya?

266
00:23:02,672 --> 00:23:06,009
Aku dapat tawaran
gaji dua kali lipat. Besok wawancara.

267
00:23:07,219 --> 00:23:10,347
Kau keren, tahu?

268
00:23:10,847 --> 00:23:11,848
Oh, ya!

269
00:23:13,225 --> 00:23:14,267
Apa lagi?

270
00:23:15,310 --> 00:23:16,561
Uang saku bulan ini.

271
00:23:18,230 --> 00:23:19,606
- Terima kasih.
- Ya.

272
00:23:22,359 --> 00:23:24,778
5, 10, 15, 20, 25, 30…

273
00:23:26,446 --> 00:23:27,531
Lima puluh ribu?

274
00:23:28,281 --> 00:23:29,574
Kelebihan 50.000 won.

275
00:23:29,658 --> 00:23:32,202
Uang 300.000 won untuk latihan.

276
00:23:32,285 --> 00:23:34,413
Aku perlu mengecek pakai 50.000 won.

277
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:36,081
Mengecek apa?

278
00:23:38,333 --> 00:23:40,127
- Kekuatan super itu.
- Ya.

279
00:23:40,210 --> 00:23:42,421
Kekuatanmu setara uang yang dipegang.

280
00:23:42,504 --> 00:23:44,756
- Ya.
- Kalau begitu, apakah…

281
00:23:44,840 --> 00:23:48,677
Apa seluruh tubuhmu jadi kuat? Semuanya?

282
00:23:49,386 --> 00:23:50,220
Kurasa begitu.

283
00:23:53,014 --> 00:23:55,642
Kalau 50.000 won,

284
00:23:56,143 --> 00:23:57,144
bisa berapa lama?

285
00:23:57,227 --> 00:23:58,061
Apanya?

286
00:24:12,492 --> 00:24:13,452
Oh!

287
00:24:17,914 --> 00:24:19,166
Entahlah kalau itu.

288
00:24:20,667 --> 00:24:23,795
Kurasa aku harus memastikannya.

289
00:24:23,879 --> 00:24:25,046
Memastikan?

290
00:24:53,074 --> 00:24:56,077
Tubuhmu jadi sangat bagus.

291
00:24:56,161 --> 00:24:58,163
Aku angkat 32 botol air sekaligus.

292
00:25:13,845 --> 00:25:17,182
- Cepat pakai.
- Kau akan sangat kaget.

293
00:25:20,977 --> 00:25:22,562
- Kang Sang-ung.
- Kenapa?

294
00:25:22,646 --> 00:25:25,815
- Kenapa kau makin kuat?
- Hei, aku Kang Sang-ung!

295
00:25:27,859 --> 00:25:29,694
- Di mana Pak Gi?
- Sedang diobati.

296
00:25:29,778 --> 00:25:32,364
Sialan. Kenapa lama sekali?

297
00:25:43,583 --> 00:25:44,417
DISETUJUI

298
00:26:20,745 --> 00:26:23,248
Tubuhnya mungkin tak kuat karena cedera.

299
00:26:23,873 --> 00:26:26,793
Sulit bertahan hidup
dengan satu kualifikasi.

300
00:26:28,420 --> 00:26:30,463
Daripada dia mati begitu saja,

301
00:26:30,547 --> 00:26:32,966
lebih baik mati setelah mencoba sesuatu.

302
00:26:34,801 --> 00:26:36,845
Anggap saja ini suplemen.

303
00:26:38,138 --> 00:26:39,139
Suntikkan saja.

304
00:26:41,433 --> 00:26:42,392
Tak mau?

305
00:26:43,435 --> 00:26:45,270
Atau kau saja yang disuntik.

306
00:27:16,885 --> 00:27:18,094
Omong-omong,

307
00:27:18,803 --> 00:27:20,055
kita mau ke mana?

308
00:27:21,181 --> 00:27:22,557
Menangkap penjahat.

309
00:27:41,117 --> 00:27:42,577
Turunkan semuanya.

310
00:27:43,870 --> 00:27:45,580
Tunggu, ini semua?

311
00:27:46,790 --> 00:27:48,792
Kita antar sampai ke sana.

312
00:27:50,085 --> 00:27:52,504
Katamu, kita menangkap penjahat?

313
00:27:53,588 --> 00:27:56,591
Penjahat terburuk
bagi orang miskin adalah dingin.

314
00:27:58,051 --> 00:27:58,927
Baik.

315
00:28:14,109 --> 00:28:17,237
- Pakai kekuatanmu jika lelah.
- Aku tak punya uang.

316
00:28:17,737 --> 00:28:18,571
Duluan saja.

317
00:28:39,926 --> 00:28:42,053
Pak Tua, aku datang.

318
00:28:42,554 --> 00:28:43,680
Masuklah.

319
00:28:49,269 --> 00:28:50,103
Roti-mi.

320
00:28:51,229 --> 00:28:52,480
Kita di mana?

321
00:28:52,564 --> 00:28:55,233
- Rumah Pak Tua Do.
- Siapa Pak Tua Do?

322
00:28:55,316 --> 00:28:57,444
Manusia super yang sangat tua.

323
00:28:59,279 --> 00:29:00,864
Apa kekuatannya?

324
00:29:01,698 --> 00:29:04,409
Dia yang terkuat di antara kita.

325
00:29:07,954 --> 00:29:09,581
Dia melihat masa depan.

326
00:29:13,001 --> 00:29:15,044
Dia akan beri tahu kesiapanmu.

327
00:29:15,128 --> 00:29:16,379
Masuklah.

328
00:29:30,894 --> 00:29:33,521
TUHAN ADALAH GEMBALAKU,
TAKKAN KEKURANGAN AKU

329
00:29:44,991 --> 00:29:47,243
- Kau putranya Dong-gi?
- Benar.

330
00:29:48,036 --> 00:29:49,954
- Pasti dompetmu kering.
- Apa?

331
00:29:52,499 --> 00:29:53,583
Benar.

332
00:29:53,666 --> 00:29:56,252
Biar rumahku begini, aku orang kaya.

333
00:29:57,253 --> 00:29:59,839
- Baik.
- Samsung Electronics 100.000 won?

334
00:30:00,715 --> 00:30:01,549
Sahamnya?

335
00:30:02,550 --> 00:30:04,135
Tidak.

336
00:30:04,636 --> 00:30:07,263
Mungkin berhenti di sekitar 60.000 won.

337
00:30:07,347 --> 00:30:08,473
Ya, ampun.

338
00:30:09,808 --> 00:30:12,101
Harusnya aku jual saat 80.000 won.

339
00:30:13,728 --> 00:30:17,774
Aku datang karena katanya
kau akan memberi tahu soal kesiapanku.

340
00:30:19,609 --> 00:30:21,027
Benar.

341
00:30:22,904 --> 00:30:25,114
Biar kulihat.

342
00:30:39,212 --> 00:30:40,213
Apa lagi?

343
00:30:45,552 --> 00:30:46,678
Bajingan!

344
00:30:46,761 --> 00:30:47,637
Maaf.

345
00:30:47,720 --> 00:30:49,973
Emas di kegelapan kehilangan sinarnya.

346
00:30:51,391 --> 00:30:54,727
Kekuatan orang besar juga hilang sia-sia.

347
00:30:56,563 --> 00:30:58,523
Apa maksudmu?

348
00:31:00,817 --> 00:31:02,944
Namun, bagai melempar koin ke sumur,

349
00:31:03,027 --> 00:31:04,946
saat melemparmu demi mereka,

350
00:31:05,488 --> 00:31:06,489
emasnya

351
00:31:07,323 --> 00:31:09,826
akan kembali menemukan sinarnya.

352
00:31:13,371 --> 00:31:14,998
Apa yang dia bicarakan?

353
00:31:24,966 --> 00:31:26,217
Pak Tua!

354
00:31:28,303 --> 00:31:30,305
Pak Tua!

355
00:31:37,604 --> 00:31:39,188
Kau putranya Dong-gi?

356
00:31:42,317 --> 00:31:43,151
Benar.

357
00:31:45,778 --> 00:31:47,196
Pasti dompetmu kering.

358
00:31:51,242 --> 00:31:52,243
Ya.

359
00:31:57,206 --> 00:31:58,499
Apa kata Pak Tua?

360
00:32:00,710 --> 00:32:01,711
Tidak ada.

361
00:32:03,338 --> 00:32:05,632
Kurasa dia hanya aneh.

362
00:32:05,715 --> 00:32:07,550
Matanya tiba-tiba memutih.

363
00:32:08,259 --> 00:32:09,135
Ya.

364
00:32:10,136 --> 00:32:11,888
Dia pasti bicara seperlunya.

365
00:32:13,097 --> 00:32:16,476
Dia lupa masa lalu
karena melihat masa depan.

366
00:32:19,270 --> 00:32:20,605
Kita semua pun begitu.

367
00:32:21,689 --> 00:32:24,108
Uang, kesehatan, dan ingatan berharga.

368
00:32:26,110 --> 00:32:27,236
Mau bagaimana lagi?

369
00:32:30,531 --> 00:32:31,532
Roti-mi.

370
00:32:36,245 --> 00:32:37,121
Kemarilah!

371
00:32:38,706 --> 00:32:39,832
Kenapa?

372
00:33:07,652 --> 00:33:08,778
Terima kasih.

373
00:33:09,904 --> 00:33:10,822
Kau jadi sopan?

374
00:33:11,656 --> 00:33:12,490
Jangan bahas.

375
00:33:15,243 --> 00:33:16,202
Itu mereka.

376
00:33:24,961 --> 00:33:26,129
KONSTRUKSI DOSANG

377
00:33:26,170 --> 00:33:28,339
Cepat turun! Semua ke atas!

378
00:33:28,423 --> 00:33:31,050
Cepat turun! Target kita di atas!

379
00:33:56,868 --> 00:33:59,620
Roti-mi. Bawa Pak Tua ke tempat aman.

380
00:34:03,416 --> 00:34:05,293
- Tuan Sang-ung.
- Ya.

381
00:34:07,420 --> 00:34:08,921
- Ini.
- Oke.

382
00:34:09,005 --> 00:34:10,131
Kaburlah.

383
00:34:10,757 --> 00:34:13,009
- Apa?
- Kau tak boleh tertangkap.

384
00:34:13,092 --> 00:34:15,470
Itu cukup untuk lompati turap di sana.

385
00:34:15,553 --> 00:34:17,513
Apa maksudmu? Bagaimana denganmu?

386
00:34:18,514 --> 00:34:20,266
Ini gang. Aku bisa berkelahi.

387
00:34:21,309 --> 00:34:22,894
- Tetapi…
- Cepat pergi.

388
00:34:50,922 --> 00:34:53,508
- Tak ada yang bisa lewat!
- Dorong!

389
00:35:10,441 --> 00:35:11,692
Ya, ampun!

390
00:35:29,919 --> 00:35:31,879
KETUA PARK JEONG-JA

391
00:35:32,880 --> 00:35:33,798
Kenapa?

392
00:35:35,341 --> 00:35:36,843
Kau mau sesuatu dariku, 'kan?

393
00:35:38,636 --> 00:35:41,013
Ada angin apa kau bicara begitu?

394
00:35:41,097 --> 00:35:44,809
Misalnya, mengejar ayahku
atau menyuruhku menikahi putrimu.

395
00:35:45,935 --> 00:35:47,728
Kau bilang ingin menyuruhku?

396
00:35:48,479 --> 00:35:50,648
Kau tak peduli soal uangnya, 'kan?

397
00:35:53,943 --> 00:35:56,654
Hentikan omong kosongmu.
Lunasi saja utangnya.

398
00:35:56,737 --> 00:35:57,905
Akan kulakukan.

399
00:36:03,911 --> 00:36:05,371
Kulakukan apa pun itu.

400
00:36:08,666 --> 00:36:11,085
Apa pun?

401
00:36:11,169 --> 00:36:12,170
Akan tetapi…

402
00:36:15,715 --> 00:36:17,300
tolong pinjami aku uang.

403
00:36:23,264 --> 00:36:26,225
Semua meneleponku
saat mereka melarat saja.

404
00:36:28,936 --> 00:36:30,062
Mohon maaf.

405
00:36:30,563 --> 00:36:32,690
Calon menantuku menelepon.

406
00:36:34,942 --> 00:36:36,694
Tidak apa-apa.

407
00:36:37,195 --> 00:36:39,071
Namamu Kim Min-suk?

408
00:36:39,655 --> 00:36:40,489
Ya.

409
00:36:41,490 --> 00:36:42,867
Senang bertemu kau.

410
00:37:03,387 --> 00:37:05,056
- Pak Tua tak apa-apa?
- Ya.

411
00:37:05,139 --> 00:37:07,433
- Roti-mi, kau tak apa?
- Aku tak apa.

412
00:37:30,873 --> 00:37:32,458
Sial.

413
00:37:39,340 --> 00:37:40,675
- Hei.
- Aduh.

414
00:38:01,070 --> 00:38:04,282
Kalian kira justru aman
kalau berkeliaran siang hari?

415
00:38:06,117 --> 00:38:07,243
Semuanya berkumpul.

416
00:38:07,743 --> 00:38:09,412
Sedang makan-makan, ya?

417
00:38:09,495 --> 00:38:11,247
Harusnya begini sejak awal.

418
00:38:12,790 --> 00:38:15,501
Omong-omong, di mana Kang Sang-ung?

419
00:38:17,503 --> 00:38:20,715
Aku sudah menunggu ingin melihat wajahmu.

420
00:38:25,344 --> 00:38:27,722
Aku harus lihat langsung wajah orang

421
00:38:28,431 --> 00:38:30,349
agar bisa membaca masa depannya.

422
00:38:31,392 --> 00:38:32,226
Apa?

423
00:39:02,798 --> 00:39:04,425
Dia akan segera kembali.

424
00:39:05,551 --> 00:39:07,511
Kau akan diusir dari rumah.

425
00:39:09,638 --> 00:39:11,599
Hari kematianmu sudah dekat.

426
00:39:15,561 --> 00:39:18,731
Pistol yang kaupakai akan…

427
00:39:50,096 --> 00:39:52,973
Kurasa, celana dalamnya harus lebih besar.

428
00:39:54,350 --> 00:39:56,018
Lihat. Uangnya tidak muat.

429
00:40:02,024 --> 00:40:03,484
Tuan Sang-ung.

430
00:40:03,567 --> 00:40:05,778
- Paman.
- Jangan panggil paman.

431
00:40:06,946 --> 00:40:07,863
Pak Tua.

432
00:40:08,572 --> 00:40:09,990
Kang Sang-ung.

433
00:40:10,991 --> 00:40:12,284
Kau mencariku?

434
00:40:28,884 --> 00:40:30,219
Ini bukan uang biasa.

435
00:40:31,387 --> 00:40:35,224
Ini kredit bunga tertinggi
dari penalang ilegal.

436
00:40:36,684 --> 00:40:41,397
Masa depanku sirna jika menunggak.

437
00:41:26,609 --> 00:41:28,110
Paman!

438
00:41:51,342 --> 00:41:52,885
Tak ada hentinya memakai uang.

439
00:41:54,428 --> 00:41:56,138
Gaji cuma mampir di rekening.

440
00:41:56,639 --> 00:42:01,602
Urusan keluarga dan tagihan
terus bertamu tanpa lelah.

441
00:42:06,190 --> 00:42:07,107
Seperti mereka.

442
00:42:33,217 --> 00:42:34,552
SILAKAN ISI KALORI

443
00:42:34,635 --> 00:42:35,844
Sial.

444
00:42:37,513 --> 00:42:38,847
Aduh.

445
00:42:55,281 --> 00:42:56,532
Astaga!

446
00:42:56,615 --> 00:42:57,700
Jangan mendekat!

447
00:43:21,390 --> 00:43:23,058
Ya, ampun. Sialan.

448
00:44:09,188 --> 00:44:10,981
Uangmu habis, 'kan, Miskin?

449
00:44:21,950 --> 00:44:25,037
Kau rajin olahraga, ya?
Badanmu makin kekar.

450
00:44:36,423 --> 00:44:37,591
Bedebah itu…

451
00:44:58,404 --> 00:45:00,155
Astaga.

452
00:45:30,310 --> 00:45:32,062
Aku terbakar jika mendekat

453
00:45:32,563 --> 00:45:34,106
dan dihajar jika menjauh.

454
00:45:39,611 --> 00:45:40,654
Bagaimana ini?

455
00:46:17,483 --> 00:46:18,317
Astaga.

456
00:49:21,458 --> 00:49:24,836
Terjemahan subtitle oleh Siti Muthia Hasna
